'''Shadowspeed''' is a spell which allows the caster to move at extreme speeds for a few seconds. A similar spell to [[Nimblefire]], Shadowspeed is used for quick bursts of speed as opposed to prolonged speed. It is commonly associated with members of the Organization.

== History ==
Somewhere around the [[Seine River]], [[Unnamed Suit 001]] used Shadowspeed against [[Lok Lambert]]. The Suit managed to grab onto Lok's leg and toss him with the spell's aid, but Lok was able to land safely.{{Source|Into the River of Secrets}}

While inside the [[Paris Catacombs|Paris catacombs]] trying to get the [[Ring of Arc]] to a [[Huntik Foundation|Huntik]] safehouse, [[Zhalia Moon]] cast this spell against Unnamed Suit 001, [[Ms. Thorpe]] and [[Mr. MacTavish]]. Under its effects, she managed to knock out the first with the help of [[Darksleep]], as well as Thorpe and later, in conjunction with [[Mindsight]], MacTavish. {{Source|Divide and Conquer}}

On a one-on-one duel at the [[Sutos Island]], Grier used this spell alongside Dante's [[Nimblefire]]. They both traded superhuman speed-punches for a brief moment. {{Source|Like Father, Unlike Son}}

